  "prefLabel": "Bcr 105.01 Meetings",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Bcr 105.01 Meetings.\n\n(a) The board shall meet monthly and at such additional times as shall be called for by the chairman or by vote of the board.\n\n(b) The board shall hold an annual meeting in January of each year for the purpose of electing a vice-chair.\n\nSource. #8003, eff 12-12-0; ss by #10098, eff 3-12-12",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/bcr100.html"
